			"notes": "Pick the jar matching your Minecraft version:\n- `…+mc26.1.x.jar` — Minecraft 26.1.x\n- `…+mc26.2.jar` — Minecraft 26.2\n- `…+mc1.21.11.jar` — Minecraft 1.21.11\n\nNeeds Fabric Loader, Fabric API, and the matching Java (25 for 26.x, 21 for 1.21.11). JEI optional.\n\n**1.0.0** — the Upgraded Shulker Box arrives, and the mod hits its first stable release.\n\n### Added\n- **Upgraded Shulker Box** — upgrade any shulker box (Core +1 + shulker box + iron block) into one that can **store normal shulker boxes** (but not other upgraded boxes, so no infinite nesting). It's a real shulker box: animated lid, keeps its contents when broken, comes in all 16 colours plus the default, and is **dyeable** like a vanilla box (combine with a dye — contents preserved).\n  - Its item shows the **contents preview in the tooltip** (first few items + \"and N more\"), exactly like vanilla — so shulker-box preview mods work on it too.\n  - A small **gold emblem on the lid** sets it apart from a normal box (on both the item and the placed block).\n  - Can be **washed in a water cauldron** to reset to the default colour (keeps contents), like vanilla shulkers.\n  - A full vanilla drop-in: mined fastest with a pickaxe, knocked off by pistons, and it always drops with its contents (even from explosions).\n- Custom **purpur Wing Smithing Template** texture (white arrow).\n- The **Absorbing Sponge** is now mined fastest with a hoe, like a vanilla sponge.\n\nFeature parity across Minecraft 26.1.x, 26.2, and 1.21.11."
		},
